Usage of size:
  -backend string
    	explicit backend for tasks without a provider; no Claude assumption (reservation estimate)
  -budget float
    	per-call budget USD used for the reservation estimate (default 0.25)
  -json
    	JSON report
  -preferences string
    	execution preference JSON for an explicit reservation route
  -shape string
    	AxDxS ownership shape (or WxD) to size without a PLAN
  -sizing string
    	sizing.v1 calibration JSON
